{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-05-07 13:12:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A TOP RANKED FIRM, ENCOURAGES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - IBM', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION (NYSE: IBM) BETWEEN APRIL 4, 2017 AND OCTOBER 20, 2021,\xa0INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JUNE 6, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED IBM SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}